{"id":"n67831-1-7","stage":5,"title":"열람실 · 阅览室","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67831-1-7-1","ko":"오늘은 도서관에 안 가고 집에서 공부하니?","zh":"今天不去图书馆了，就在家学习吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘은","audio":"/audio/45021ad1ec5b4083b856.mp3"}},{"text":"도서관에","meaning":"图书馆","explanation":"도서관：图书馆；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"도서관","audio":"/audio/9ee22c8536d3503a4b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40295","senseId":"1","lemma":"도서관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도서관에","audio":"/audio/5f81e45a6e4a14c4ae9e.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"가고","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가고","audio":"/audio/1fb46b7cd8a51290e6be.mp3"}},{"text":"집에서","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에서","audio":"/audio/c00afeb6cadab90f0098.mp3"}},{"text":"공부하니?","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부하다：学习，读书；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"공부하다","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23394","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부하니","audio":"/audio/5e9275af2a589a61e9df.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"9ee22c8536d3503a","term":"도서관","zh":"图书馆","audio":"/audio/9ee22c8536d3503a4b1c.mp3","entryId":"40295","definition":"收藏大量书籍和资料等，以供人们借阅或学习而建造的设施。","pronunciation":["도서관"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"002a60f979d8c3de","term":"공부하다","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/002a60f979d8c3de292f.mp3","entryId":"23394","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a8ca09ad6c25027ea719.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67831-1-7-2","ko":"아까 책을 읽으러 갔었는데 열람실에 자리가 없더라고.","zh":"刚才去读书了，结果自习室没有空位。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}},{"text":"책을","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책을","audio":"/audio/e44a325e9f08fbcedc00.mp3"}},{"text":"읽으러","meaning":"阅读","explanation":"읽다：阅读；으러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做…